- Right.

270
00:08:31,650 --> 00:08:32,750
We went there with KARINA.

271
00:08:32,750 --> 00:08:34,490
Was it because of this contest?

272
00:08:34,920 --> 00:08:36,290
- No, that's not the case.
- No. Not at all.

273
00:08:36,520 --> 00:08:37,720
- We just wanted to eat with him.
- That's not the case.

274
00:08:37,720 --> 00:08:39,590
- Not at all.
- We already had plans...

275
00:08:39,590 --> 00:08:41,130
- to eat with him.
- Right.

276
00:08:41,130 --> 00:08:42,960
A few days before we met him,

277
00:08:42,960 --> 00:08:45,100
