323
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:26,960
- Yes, I can.
- You can?

324
00:10:27,670 --> 00:10:28,700
Then let's wait and see.

325
00:10:28,700 --> 00:10:30,800
- By the way, Jeom Soon, - Yes?

326
00:10:30,800 --> 00:10:32,100
how hard did you work to prepare...

327
00:10:32,100 --> 00:10:33,440
