- To find a way to do it well?

341
00:11:02,730 --> 00:11:04,070
I tried to find a way to do it quickly.

342
00:11:04,070 --> 00:11:06,840
Yu Jin, what did you do to prepare for this contest?

343
00:11:06,840 --> 00:11:08,270
