348
00:11:18,150 --> 00:11:19,850
- Yu Jin, you were amazing.
- That was good.

349
00:11:19,850 --> 00:11:21,350
- You looked so sexy.
- That was good.

350
00:11:21,350 --> 00:11:22,890
