- Hold on.

401
00:13:01,350 --> 00:13:03,520
It's in Goheung where the Naro rocket was launched.

402
00:13:03,520 --> 00:13:05,320
It's really far away from here.

403
00:13:05,320 --> 00:13:08,130
I've been there for a shoot, and it was really far.

404
00:13:08,130 --> 00:13:10,030
- It's really far away from here.
- So it's not in Gangnam?

405
00:13:10,030 --> 00:13:11,630
