- We'll open it in Goheung.

406
00:13:11,630 --> 00:13:12,830
It's practically right next to Ttangkkeut Village.

407
00:13:13,430 --> 00:13:15,430
(Goheung)

408
00:13:15,700 --> 00:13:16,870
(Goheung sits at the southern tip of the Korean Peninsula,)

409
00:13:16,870 --> 00:13:18,040
