793
00:26:25,320 --> 00:26:26,820
Hello, it's nice to meet you.

794
00:26:26,820 --> 00:26:30,430
Viewers, this is Lee Geum Ja of Neapolitan Tteokfia.

795
00:26:30,930 --> 00:26:33,400
- Isn't your name Lee Jeom Soon?
- No, it's Geum Ja.

796
00:26:33,500 --> 00:26:35,400
