797
00:26:35,570 --> 00:26:38,400
I'm all about "simple is the best." "Kiddies are the best."

798
00:26:38,640 --> 00:26:40,270
"Rice cakes are the best." When you think of rice cakes,

799
00:26:40,270 --> 00:26:42,640
