814
00:27:22,980 --> 00:27:24,310
(I suddenly lost confidence.)

815
00:27:24,310 --> 00:27:26,350
(I will do my best. Thank you.)

816
00:27:26,420 --> 00:27:28,350
I poured my life...

817
00:27:28,450 --> 00:27:30,750
