818
00:27:31,760 --> 00:27:34,390
(I need to get garaetteok that's 175cm long.)

819
00:27:34,620 --> 00:27:35,960
Gosh, it's a griddle.

820
00:27:35,960 --> 00:27:37,090
(Is there a place where I can use a tteokbokki griddle?)

821
00:27:39,230 --> 00:27:40,930
Young Ji, what's that?

822
00:27:40,930 --> 00:27:42,970
This is the sauce I aged since last night.

823
00:27:42,970 --> 00:27:44,330
Someone else didn't make it for you, right?

824
00:27:44,330 --> 00:27:45,900
- Or you bought it...
- I really made it.

825
00:27:46,340 --> 00:27:48,040
I've been eating only tteokbokki for a month.

826
00:27:49,010 --> 00:27:50,410
This sauce went through...

827
