859
00:29:05,950 --> 00:29:07,550
- No way.
- I don't believe it.

860
00:29:07,550 --> 00:29:09,320
She talked about it two years ago.

861
00:29:09,320 --> 00:29:11,220
She can't have done exactly that.

862
00:29:11,220 --> 00:29:12,420
Someone must have done it already.

863
00:29:12,420 --> 00:29:13,920
