889
00:30:17,850 --> 00:30:19,860
Please don't make it too spicy.

890
00:30:20,360 --> 00:30:21,390
Okay.

891
00:30:22,730 --> 00:30:25,360
I don't see anything particularly special.

892
00:30:25,730 --> 00:30:29,070
But I have plans B, C, and D.

893
00:30:30,070 --> 00:30:31,500
- I have everything planned out.
- You do?

894
00:30:31,530 --> 00:30:33,600
- I was just about to add it.
- I knew it.

895
00:30:34,370 --> 00:30:38,470
