908
00:31:15,710 --> 00:31:16,880
Hello.

909
00:31:17,110 --> 00:31:20,480
Competing in the Space Rice Cake's Head Chef Selection,

910
00:31:20,720 --> 00:31:22,420
I'm Monkfish Beast.

911
00:31:22,750 --> 00:31:24,920
