921
00:31:52,120 --> 00:31:54,550
I remembered how much I enjoyed it.

922
00:31:54,550 --> 00:31:58,150
So I decided to make gimbap with it.

923
00:31:58,550 --> 00:32:00,490
When you look at handmade candy,

924
