- Everything is a finished product.

933
00:32:33,820 --> 00:32:36,660
At first, I was going to use only garaetteok.

934
00:32:36,660 --> 00:32:39,930
But it was too difficult, and the shape wasn't coming out right.

935
00:32:40,330 --> 00:32:42,530
So I thought of using...

936
00:32:42,630 --> 00:32:45,200
