943
00:33:05,220 --> 00:33:07,490
Then it becomes sunglasses.

944
00:33:08,790 --> 00:33:10,990
The white part becomes Torong's face.

945
00:33:11,190 --> 00:33:12,430
That's also made with rice dough.

946
00:33:14,000 --> 00:33:16,400
With pink garaetteok,

947
00:33:16,400 --> 00:33:18,300
