948
00:33:18,630 --> 00:33:20,440
And finally,

949
00:33:20,770 --> 00:33:24,170
I wrap it all again with white rice dough.

950
00:33:25,170 --> 00:33:28,110
Then Torong is complete.

951
00:33:28,880 --> 00:33:30,310
It's almost like slime.

952
00:33:31,210 --> 00:33:33,950
True masters don't blame their tools.

953
00:33:33,950 --> 00:33:35,220
(100 percent handmade by kneading and pounding)

954
00:33:35,520 --> 00:33:36,720
So that's why it tasted salty.

955
00:33:37,550 --> 00:33:39,920
- Chef, I'll cut it now.
- I should see the cross section.

956
00:33:40,420 --> 00:33:41,760
If the inside doesn't come out right, isn't it a failure?

957
00:33:41,760 --> 00:33:43,890
It's a failure. If the cross section doesn't work, it's over.

958
00:33:44,060 --> 00:33:46,630
