959
00:33:46,630 --> 00:33:50,100
For this dish, I only have one chance.

960
00:33:51,200 --> 00:33:54,540
If it doesn't cut cleanly...

961
00:33:54,540 --> 00:33:56,240
(If it doesn't cut cleanly...)

962
00:33:56,240 --> 00:33:57,540
I have to start all over again.

963
00:33:58,740 --> 00:34:01,010
If the cross section doesn't come out right, it's over.

964
00:34:01,010 --> 00:34:02,010
I see.

965
00:34:02,780 --> 00:34:04,780
Cross section, please!

966
00:34:04,780 --> 00:34:06,880
(Monkfish Beast calls out the cross section.)

967
00:34:13,660 --> 00:34:14,720
How will it turn out?

968
00:34:16,560 --> 00:34:18,030
- What?
- It looks okay.

969
00:34:18,030 --> 00:34:19,230
