- Yes.

970
00:34:19,730 --> 00:34:22,230
- Are you sure about that?
- Yes, it's good.

971
00:34:22,530 --> 00:34:23,770
This is good enough.

972
00:34:24,230 --> 00:34:26,040
Actually, I was satisfied.

973
00:34:26,600 --> 00:34:27,840
Before this,

974
00:34:27,840 --> 00:34:31,710
